{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A Woodall number is of the form k * 2^k - 1 for some positive integer k.\n    \"\"\"\n    k = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = k * (2**k) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == n:\n            return True\n        if woodall_candidate > n:\n            return False\n        k += 1"}
