{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of contiguous substrings in a string of digits\n    where the sum of the digits in the substring equals the substring's length.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(s)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(s[j])\n            substring_length = j - i + 1\n            if current_sum == substring_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
