{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(words, patterns):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a sequence of words follows the pattern specified by a sequence of characters.\n    Both sequences must have a one-to-one mapping between elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(words) != len(patterns):\n        return False\n\n    word_to_pattern = {}\n    pattern_to_word = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(words)):\n        word = words[i]\n        pattern_char = patterns[i]\n\n        if word in word_to_pattern:\n            if word_to_pattern[word] != pattern_char:\n                return False\n        else:\n            word_to_pattern[word] = pattern_char\n        \n        if pattern_char in pattern_to_word:\n            if pattern_to_word[pattern_char] != word:\n                return False\n        else:\n            pattern_to_word[pattern_char] = word\n\n    return True"}
