{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "def pancake_sort(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of comparable elements using the pancake sort algorithm.\n    Returns a new sorted list, preserving the original.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return list(input_list)\n\n    arr = list(input_list)\n\n    def _flip(sublist, k):\n        \"\"\"Reverses the prefix of the sublist up to index k (inclusive).\"\"\"\n        left = 0\n        while left < k:\n            sublist[left], sublist[k] = sublist[k], sublist[left]\n            left += 1\n            k -= 1\n\n    for current_unsorted_end in range(n - 1, 0, -1):\n        # Find the index of the maximum element in the unsorted prefix arr[0...current_unsorted_end]\n        max_val_index = 0\n        for i in range(1, current_unsorted_end + 1):\n            if arr[i] > arr[max_val_index]:\n                max_val_index = i\n\n        # If the maximum element is not already at its correct final position, perform flips.\n        if max_val_index != current_unsorted_end:\n            # First flip: bring the maximum element to the front of the unsorted prefix.\n            _flip(arr, max_val_index)\n            # Second flip: move the maximum element from the front to its sorted position.\n            _flip(arr, current_unsorted_end)\n\n    return arr"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/145", "solution": "from dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import List, Sequence as PySequence, Union\nNumber = Union[int, float]\nclass MaxAbsDiffCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Domain service that calculates the maximum absolute difference.\"\"\"\n    def compute(self, sequence: Sequence) -> Number:\n        max_val = max(sequence.elements)\n        min_val = min(sequence.elements)\n        return max_val - min_val\ndef max_Abs_Diff(seq: PySequence[Number]) -> Number:\n    \"\"\"\n    Compute the maximum absolute difference between any two elements.\n    It identifies the largest and smallest values and returns their difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    elements: List[Number] = list(seq)\n    sequence = Sequence(elements)\n    calculator = MaxAbsDiffCalculator()\n    return calculator.compute(sequence)"}
