{"task_id": "Mbpp/252", "solution": "import math\ndef convert(value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a complex number (or real number) to its polar coordinates.\n    Returns a tuple (magnitude, angle) of floats.\n    \"\"\"\n    z = complex(value)\n    real_part = z.real\n    imag_part = z.imag\n    \n    magnitude = math.sqrt(real_part**2 + imag_part**2)\n    angle = math.atan2(imag_part, real_part)\n    \n    return magnitude, angle"}
