{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(lst: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list into n sublists by distributing elements to every nth sublist.\n    \"\"\"\n    sublists = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    for idx, element in enumerate(lst):\n        sublist_index = idx % n\n        sublists[sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return sublists"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    The input n is assumed to be a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # Closed-form formula: sum_{k=1}^{n} (2k-1)^2 = (4n^3 - n) / 3\n    return (4 * n ** 3 - n) // 3"}
