{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "class PowerCalculator:\n    def power(self, base: int, exponent: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Return base raised to exponent.\"\"\"\n        return base ** exponent\nclass SumCalculator:\n    def __init__(self, power_calculator: PowerCalculator):\n        self.power_calculator = power_calculator\n\n    def sum_of_even_powers(self, n: int) -> int:\n        if n <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n        total = 0\n        for i in range(1, n + 1):\n            even_value = 2 * i\n            powered = self.power_calculator.power(even_value, 5)\n            total += powered\n        return total\ndef even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the sum of the first n even natural numbers each raised to the fifth power.\"\"\"\n    calculator = SumCalculator(PowerCalculator())\n    return calculator.sum_of_even_powers(n)"}
