{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    # C(n, k) = C(n, k-1) * (n - k + 1) // k\n    coefficients = [1]  # C(n, 0) is always 1\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        # Calculate C(n, k) based on C(n, k-1)\n        next_coeff = coefficients[-1] * (n - k + 1) // k\n        coefficients.append(next_coeff)\n\n    # Sum coefficients at even indices (0-based)\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(0, len(coefficients), 2):\n        total_sum += coefficients[i]\n        \n    return total_sum"}
