{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "def max_Product(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds a pair of integers from the given array with the highest product.\n    Iterates through all possible pairs and tracks the one with the maximum product.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    max_prod = float('-inf')\n    result_pair = (None, None)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            current_prod = arr[i] * arr[j]\n            if current_prod > max_prod:\n                max_prod = current_prod\n                result_pair = (arr[i], arr[j])\n    return result_pair"}
