{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    # The sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers is given by the formula:\n    # (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2. Using integer division for intermediate steps.\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n\n    # Calculate the average by dividing the sum by n.\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average"}
