{"task_id": "Mbpp/440", "solution": "def find_adverb_position(sentence: str) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first adverb and its positions (start, end) in a given sentence.\n    Returns (start_index, end_index, adverb_word) or None if no adverb is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    _ADVERB_SET = {\n        \"clearly\", \"quickly\", \"slowly\", \"very\", \"always\", \"never\", \"often\",\n        \"sometimes\", \"usually\", \"just\", \"almost\", \"quite\", \"rather\", \"too\",\n        \"enough\", \"indeed\", \"instead\", \"now\", \"then\", \"today\", \"tomorrow\",\n        \"tonight\", \"yesterday\", \"still\", \"yet\", \"here\", \"there\", \"up\",\n        \"down\", \"out\", \"in\", \"away\", \"back\", \"how\", \"why\", \"thus\", \"where\",\n        \"when\", \"soon\", \"early\", \"late\", \"finally\", \"only\", \"also\", \"even\",\n        \"much\", \"more\", \"most\", \"well\", \"badly\", \"hard\", \"soft\", \"loud\",\n        \"quiet\", \"fast\", \"straight\", \"daily\", \"weekly\", \"monthly\", \"yearly\",\n        \"ago\", \"recently\", \"lately\", \"already\", \"ever\", \"seldom\", \"rarely\",\n        \"hardly\", \"scarcely\", \"barely\", \"probably\", \"possibly\", \"perhaps\",\n        \"maybe\", \"obviously\", \"evidently\", \"apparently\", \"generally\", \"normally\",\n        \"frequently\", \"occasionally\", \"subsequently\", \"eventually\", \"presently\",\n        \"currently\", \"actually\", \"really\", \"truly\", \"certainly\", \"surely\",\n        \"meanwhile\", \"otherwise\", \"hence\", \"therefore\", \"consequently\", \"accordingly\",\n        \"additionally\", \"alternatively\", \"anyway\", \"besides\", \"chiefly\", \"equally\",\n        \"especially\", \"exceptionally\", \"fortunately\", \"frankly\", \"ideally\",\n        \"importantly\", \"incidentally\", \"initially\", \"lastly\", \"likewise\", \"mainly\",\n        \"moreover\", \"namely\", \"naturally\", \"nevertheless\", \"next\", \"nonetheless\",\n        \"notably\", \"originally\", \"particularly\", \"personally\", \"previously\",\n        \"primarily\", \"reportedly\", \"significantly\", \"similarly\", \"simply\",\n        \"specifically\", \"suddenly\", \"surprisingly\", \"technically\", \"thankfully\",\n        \"theoretically\", \"ultimately\", \"undoubtedly\", \"unfortunately\", \"uniformly\",\n        \"unusually\", \"virtually\", \"visibly\", \"wholly\", \"widely\", \"willingly\",\n        \"wisely\", \"wonderfully\", \"worriedly\", \"wrongly\", \"zealously\", \"zestfully\"\n    }\n    _PUNCTUATION_CHARS = \".,!?;:()[]{}\\\"'\"\n\n    current_offset = 0\n    words = sentence.split()\n\n    for original_word_with_punct in words:\n        start_of_full_word = sentence.find(original_word_with_punct, current_offset)\n        if start_of_full_word == -1:\n            current_offset += len(original_word_with_punct) + 1\n            continue\n\n        cleaned_word = original_word_with_punct.strip(_PUNCTUATION_CHARS).lower()\n\n        if cleaned_word in _ADVERB_SET:\n            offset_in_full_word = original_word_with_punct.lower().find(cleaned_word)\n            adverb_start_abs = start_of_full_word + offset_in_full_word\n            adverb_end_abs = adverb_start_abs + len(cleaned_word)\n            return (adverb_start_abs, adverb_end_abs, cleaned_word)\n\n        current_offset = start_of_full_word + len(original_word_with_punct) + 1\n\n    return None"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of elements from two tuples of tuples.\n    Assumes valid input types and matching dimensions.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer = []\n    for inner_tuple1, inner_tuple2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result_inner = []\n        for elem1, elem2 in zip(inner_tuple1, inner_tuple2):\n            result_inner.append(elem1 * elem2)\n        result_outer.append(tuple(result_inner))\n    return tuple(result_outer)"}
