{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even positive factors of a given integer n.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of n\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            # i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += i\n\n            # n // i is also a factor\n            # Avoid double counting if i * i == n (perfect square)\n            if i * i != n:\n                factor2 = n // i\n                if factor2 % 2 == 0:\n                    total_sum += factor2\n        i += 1\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/454", "solution": "def text_match_wordz(input_string):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the input string contains any word that includes the letter 'z'.\n    Words are sequences of alphabetic characters, case-insensitive.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_word = []\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char.isalpha():\n            current_word.append(char)\n        else:\n            if current_word:\n                if 'z' in ''.join(current_word).lower():\n                    return True\n                current_word = []\n    \n    if current_word: # Check for a word at the end of the string\n        if 'z' in ''.join(current_word).lower():\n            return True\n            \n    return False"}
