{"task_id": "Mbpp/564", "solution": "def count_Pairs(values: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of possible unordered pairs where both elements are unequal.\n    It iterates through all unique pairs (i, j) where i < j and checks for inequality.\"\"\"\n    n = len(values)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if values[i] != values[j]:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
