{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the products of consecutive binomial coefficients for a given integer n.\n    This uses an iterative method to compute binomial coefficients efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # C(n, 0) is always 1\n    prev_coeff = 1 \n\n    for k in range(n):\n        # Calculate C(n, k+1) from C(n, k) using the formula C(n, k+1) = C(n, k) * (n - k) // (k + 1)\n        current_coeff = prev_coeff * (n - k) // (k + 1)\n        \n        # Add the product of C(n, k) and C(n, k+1) to the total sum\n        total_sum += prev_coeff * current_coeff\n        \n        # Update prev_coeff for the next iteration\n        prev_coeff = current_coeff\n        \n    return total_sum"}
