{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR of all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    The parameter 'n' must match the length of the 'numbers' list.\n    \"\"\"\n    list_len = len(numbers)\n\n    if n != list_len:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be equal to the length of the numbers list\")\n\n    if list_len < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    for i in range(list_len - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, list_len):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n    return total_xor_sum"}
