{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple\ndef get_coordinates(coord: Tuple[int, int]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all nine adjacent coordinates (including the given one) for a 2D coordinate.\n    The coordinates are returned in a deterministic order: first by x-offset (-1, 0, 1), then by y-offset (-1, 0, 1).\n    \"\"\"\n    x, y = coord\n    adjacent_coords = []\n    for dx in [-1, 0, 1]:\n        for dy in [-1, 0, 1]:\n            adjacent_coords.append([x + dx, y + dy])\n    return adjacent_coords"}
